"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cb/anu9lf2juwli3i6ulol7wmqa04m1yo2.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E6%99%B6%E8%83%BD%E5%A2%9E%E7%A8%8B%E5%BC%A9.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/cb/anu9lf2juwli3i6ulol7wmqa04m1yo2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />晶能增程弩\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">物理攻击</span>]转变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">魔法攻击</span>]。与目标距离每多<font color=\"red\">1</font>格（相邻距离算0格），伤害提高<font color=\"red\">3%</font>，最多<font color=\"red\">30%</font>。若攻击前没移动，最大射程增加<font color=\"red\">1</font>格。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BC%A6%E4%BC%BD%E5%8B%92\" title=\"角色图鉴库/伦伽勒\"><img alt=\"头像 伦伽勒.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/dc/s1bk0m2lj5bxpmhksm1nmgqccdtv0pd.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">伦伽勒</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">物理攻击</span>]转变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">魔法攻击</span>]。与目标距离每多<font color=\"red\">1</font>格（相邻距离算0格），伤害提高<font color=\"red\">4%</font>，最多<font color=\"red\">40%</font>。若攻击前没移动，最大射程增加<font color=\"red\">1</font>格。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">物理攻击</span>]转变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">魔法攻击</span>]，暴击率提高<font color=\"red\">15%</font>。与目标距离每多<font color=\"red\">1</font>格（相邻距离算0格），伤害提高<font color=\"red\">4%</font>，最多<font color=\"red\">40%</font>。若攻击前没移动，最大射程增加<font color=\"red\">1</font>格。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性四星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">物理攻击</span>]转变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">魔法攻击</span>]，暴击率提高<font color=\"red\">15%</font>。与目标距离每多<font color=\"red\">1</font>格（相邻距离算0格），伤害提高<font color=\"red\">5%</font>，最多<font color=\"red\">45%</font>。若攻击前没移动，最大射程增加<font color=\"red\">1</font>格。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性五星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">物理攻击</span>]转变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">魔法攻击</span>]，暴击率提高<font color=\"red\">15%</font>。与目标距离每多<font color=\"red\">1</font>格（相邻距离算0格），伤害提高<font color=\"red\">5%</font>，最多<font color=\"red\">45%</font>。若攻击前没移动，最大射程增加<font color=\"red\">1</font>格。攻击<font color=\"red\">5</font>格及以外的敌人时，施加目标[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×反应技\" class=\"bil